{"ticker":"DXCM","updated":"2026-11-12T23:14:14Z","profile":{"longName":"DexCom, Inc.","shortName":"DexCom, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Devices","country":"United States","website":"https://www.dexcom.com","fullTimeEmployees":11000,"marketCap":30354475008,"trailingPE":32.04331,"forwardPE":25.96313,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.9467273,"pegRatio":1.27,"targetMeanPrice":98.57692,"targetHighPrice":120.0,"targetLowPrice":79.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.112,"earningsGrowth":0.026,"grossMargins":0.63424,"operatingMargins":0.23975,"profitMargins":0.19415002,"totalRevenue":5104399872,"beta":1.443,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":92.59,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":56.72,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"DexCom, Inc., a medical device company, focuses on the design, development, and commercialization of continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) systems for the management of diabetes and metabolic health in the United States and internationally. The company offers Dexcom G7 and G7 15 Day, an integrated continuous glucose monitoring system; Dexcom G6, a CGM system; Dexcom ONE+ to replace fingerstick blood glucose testing for diabetes treatment decisions; Stelo, a biosensor designed for adults with prediabetes and Type 2 diabetes who do not use insulin; Dexcom Share, a remote monitoring system; and Dexcom Follow application. It markets its products directly to endocrinologists, physicians, and diabetes educators. The company was incorporated in 1999 and is headquartered in San Diego, California.","summary_zh":"DexCom, Inc. 是一家醫療器材公司，專注於連續血糖監測 (CGM) 系統的設計、開發和商業化，用於美國和國際上的糖尿病和代謝健康管理。該公司提供 Dexcom G7 和 G7 15 Day，這是一種整合的連續血糖監測系統； Dexcom G6，CG​​ 系統；Dexcom ONE+ 取代指尖血糖測試以做出糖尿病治療決策； Stelo，一種生物感測器，專為不使用胰島素的糖尿病前期和 2 型糖尿病成人而設計； Dexcom Share，一種生物感測器，專為不使用胰島素的糖尿病前期和 2 型糖尿病成人而設計； Dexcom Share，遠端監控系統；它直接向內分泌學家、醫生和糖尿病教育者銷售其產品。該公司成立於1999年，總部位於加州聖地牙哥。","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療器材","candles"